# Optional local overrides — copy to .npmrc only if you need to customize registry settings.
# Local shared development uses `pnpm install:local` (symlinks ../lcs-shared).
# CI and published installs use `pnpm install:ci` / `pnpm install:published`.
#
# pnpm 11 reads only auth, registry, TLS and proxy settings from .npmrc; everything
# else lives in pnpm-workspace.yaml. It also refuses ${VAR} tokens in a project
# .npmrc, so put your GitHub Packages token in ~/.npmrc (`pnpm setup:npm-auth`).
# @learncraft-spanish:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
